sequenceDiagram
    %% SD7 - Manage previous games
    %% Stories: 16, 17, 18, 19, 20
    %% Description: The moderator browses previous games, views and exports a transcript, and deletes a game.
    actor M as Moderator
    participant G as Game
    participant R as Round
    participant I as Item

    %% covers 16
    M->>G: browse previous games
    %% covers 17
    M->>G: view transcript
    G->>R: rounds
    R->>I: items and estimates
    %% covers 18, 19
    M->>G: export transcript
    %% covers 20
    M->>G: delete game
